🔥StrictMode

Strict mode is developer tool which help to detect accidental app performance like
thread violation and resource leak, it is used in debug app in application class

🔸it help to detect:
1- use network call in main thread
2- read/write and database operation in main thread
2- resource leak [like resource is not released]


🔹code Example :

if (BuildConfig.DEBUG) {
            StrictMode.setThreadPolicy(
                StrictMode.ThreadPolicy.Builder()
                    .detectDiskReads()
                    .detectDiskWrites()
                    .detectNetwork()
                    .penaltyLog()
                    .build()
            )

            StrictMode.setVmPolicy(
                StrictMode.VmPolicy.Builder()
                    .detectLeakedClosableObjects()
                    .penaltyLog()
                    .build()
            )
        }